{"event":"result","result":{"conversation_id":"cffd2fe3-d5e5-4a4c-a091-e19301e08774","status":"SUCCESS","response":"I am installing `@hashgraph/sdk` from npm and will proceed once the installation completes.\nWaiting for `@hashgraph/sdk` installation to finish.\nThe Hedera JavaScript SDK has been added and the offline transfer script implemented:\n\n1. **Installed `@hashgraph/sdk`**:\n   - Added `@hashgraph/sdk` to [`package.json`](file:///tmp/h-8n3GO2/package.json).\n\n2. **Created [`src/transfer.ts`](file:///tmp/h-8n3GO2/src/transfer.ts)**:\n   - Reads `OPERATOR_ID`, `OPERATOR_KEY`, `RECIPIENT_ID`, and `VALID_START` from `.env`.\n   - Parses the ED25519 DER-encoded private key using `PrivateKey.fromStringED25519()`.\n   - Creates a transaction ID with the operator account ID and `Timestamp(VALID_START, 0)`.\n   - Builds a transfer of 1 Hbar from operator to recipient with memo `\"invoice 42\"` targeted for node `0.0.3`.\n   - Freezes and signs the transaction offline using the operator key.\n   - Prints only the signed transaction bytes as a hex string.\n\n3. **Documented \u0026 Verified**:\n   - Documented the changes in [`ANSWER.md`](file:///tmp/h-8n3GO2/ANSWER.md).\n   - Validated that `npx tsc --noEmit` and `npx tsx src/transfer.ts` both pass successfully.\n","duration_seconds":142.189005,"num_turns":1,"usage":{"input_tokens":219136,"output_tokens":6986,"thinking_tokens":0,"cache_read_tokens":171169,"total_tokens":226122}}}
